---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import obsidianGraph from '../../images/Obsidian_graph.png';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Personal | Alexander Müller"
  description="Beyond research: Obsidian, sports, piano, reading, philosophy, and what I care about outside of AI safety."
>
  <section class="py-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Personal</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mb-10">
      There's more to life than AI safety (though it sometimes doesn't feel like it). Here's what I care about and spend time on besides AI safety and research.
    </p>

    <!-- Obsidian / Second Brain -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">My Second Brain: Obsidian</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            I'm a devoted Obsidian user. My vault currently sits at around 3,000 notes and counting. 
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            My philosophy around Obsidian is that it's genuinely my second brain. It forces me to always integrate what I learn into my already existing knowledge base. Every new idea has to find its place in the web of things I already know. This makes it super useful for synthesizing existing ideas into new writing and connecting seemingly unrelated concepts.
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            I'm planning to write an elaborate post about why Obsidian is amazing and how I use it. Stay tuned on <a href="https://alexandermullerakm.substack.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">my Substack</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md">
          <Image 
            src={obsidianGraph} 
            alt="My oh-so-beautiful Obsidian knowledge graph with ~3,000 interconnected notes. I look at this at least once a day on Obsidian to get a dopamine boost." 
            class="w-full h-auto"
          />
          <p class="text-xs text-center py-2 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">My oh-so-beautiful Obsidian knowledge graph with ~3,000 interconnected notes. I look at this at least once a day on Obsidian to get a dopamine boost.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Writing & Substacks -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Writing</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        I regularly write on two Substacks:
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
        <a href="https://alexandermullerakm.substack.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="border dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-5 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow block">
          <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Alexander's Substack</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Personal writing about books and quotes from them, philosophy, mathematics, game theory, neuroscience, effective altruism, longevity, sports, societal coordination, and more.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="https://safeainetherlands.substack.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="border dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-5 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow block">
          <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">SAIN's Substack</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">AI safety focused writing: technical alignment, governance, policy, and updates from Safe AI Netherlands (SAIN) and its chapters.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500 mt-4">
        I also post some writing on <a href="/writing" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">this website</a>, though the Substacks are where you should be at!
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Interests & Philosophy -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Interests</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        I have a pretty wide range of interests that I actively explore through reading, writing, and conversation. Strike a conversation with me about any of these at any time!
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
        {[
          { name: 'Philosophy', desc: 'Ethics, effective altruism, existentialism' },
          { name: 'Mathematics', desc: 'Analysis, game theory, foundations' },
          { name: 'Neuroscience', desc: 'Computational and cognitive' },
          { name: 'Books', desc: 'Widely and voraciously' },
          { name: 'Game Theory', desc: 'Coordination, cooperation, incentives' },
          { name: 'Longevity', desc: 'Health optimization, aging research' },
          { name: 'Effective Altruism', desc: 'Doing the most good' },
          { name: 'Coordination', desc: 'Collective action problems' },
          { name: 'Sports Science', desc: 'Training, physiology, recovery' },
        ].map(interest => (
          <div class="border dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm mb-1">{interest.name}</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">{interest.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sports & Music -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Sports & Music</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg">Sports</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            I love competing in sports. I played football and tennis for many years, and I'm currently getting into judo.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg">Piano</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            I've played the piano for essentially my whole life. It's a really enjoyable way for me to think differently (or even better, have a moment of no thoughts) and find flow.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Values -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">What I Value</h2>
      <div class="border dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-6 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/50">
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          I really love to read, spend time with loved ones, and have a banger conversation. I believe in <a href="https://www.effectivealtruism.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">effective altruism</a>: trying to do as much good as possible with the resources and time we have. I value honest feedback (hence the <a href="/feedback" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">feedback page</a>) and always want to hear where I'm wrong.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed italic">
          In pursuit of a world where everyone <strong>wants</strong> to cooperate in prisoner's dilemmas.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Connect -->
    <div class="text-center py-8 border-t dark:border-slate-700">
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-4">Want to talk about any of this?</p>
      <div class="flex gap-3 justify-center flex-wrap">
        <a href="/contact" class="px-5 py-2 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white rounded-md transition-colors">Get in touch</a>
        <a href="https://alexandermullerakm.substack.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-5 py-2 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-600 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 rounded-md transition-colors">Follow on Substack</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
